{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/3c19419c3f41745742975d1bc35dadf1.poster.avif?t=1763497591\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/3c19419c3f41745742975d1bc35dadf1.webm?t=1763497591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/3c19419c3f41745742975d1bc35dadf1.mp4?t=1763497591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>From the creator of... absolutely nothing else so far...</strong><br>...comes the latest confusing mess of a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Athyra</i> takes the simplest game everyone knows\u2014Rock, Paper, Scissors\u2014and turns it into the most complicated horror experience that not many understand (including maybe the developer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unsettling opponents, solve cryptic puzzles, and try not to question your sanity\u2014or the rules. Because yes, there are rules. Probably. Somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, it\u2019s a horror game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/6f16288eda640ecd91dbef89586209ab.poster.avif?t=1763497591\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/6f16288eda640ecd91dbef89586209ab.webm?t=1763497591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/6f16288eda640ecd91dbef89586209ab.mp4?t=1763497591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>In <i>Athyra</i>, you will...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against twisted, unsettling opponents in the simplest game you've ever known... or thought you knew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover cryptic puzzles and unsettling lore as you venture deeper into the trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore rooms full of horrors, all linked by a bizarre, unnerving connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question everything... including the game itself.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"THE TRIAL IS SIMPLE...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3645650/9bf3b935a428697d6712005e336be3530b194186.jpg"},{"name":"How much is too much?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3645650/c5f73e3a895363130451d579c5212782257b65e8.jpg"},{"name":"Desire is the root of all evil...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3645650/8b108a5a2d4a09347529779326aab7081eec4e4b.jpg"},{"name":"It's not much of a hand, but I'm sort of attached to it...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3645650/8a9a4af77e9d3c0fbc82b0e9287e69dcd669b0a5.jpg"},{"name":"Phthonos is blind, for it cannot bear the light of another's fortune...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3645650/359ace85a6f3acda9dc8d31269856cbfac6b40a2.jpg"},{"name":"Anger is a brief madness...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3645650/44ff53c48440841a2f531e5b71cb43b7be9897c4.jpg"},{"name":"A wise man knows himself to be nothing...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3645650/ba479e61e44f4b97f7df61affba0c3f5025f05c3.jpg"},{"name":"Close the door behind you...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3645650/7f96d2222eddb14bcec1b1d505ed9600cdf76ff7.jpg"},{"name":"I AM YOU...","path":"https://c